		{"id":"4738b3ad90bb70ac","type":"text","text":"标量","x":1722,"y":624,"width":117,"height":60},
		{"id":"3748c523716c9a19","type":"text","text":"```\nclass LinearModel(torch.nn.Module):\n\tdef_init_(self):\n\t\tsuper(LinearModel,self)._init_()\n\t\tself.Linear = torch.nn.Linear(1,1) //构造对象 class nn.Linear contain two member Tensors:weight and bias\n\t\n\tdef forward(self,x):\n\t\ty_pred = self.linear(x)  //w * x + b\n\t\treturn y_pred\n\t\nmodel = LinearModel()\n```","x":350,"y":1020,"width":990,"height":342},
		{"id":"372abc2f17381cc3","type":"text","text":"our model class should be inherit from nn.Module,which is base class for all nerual network modules","x":1520,"y":1139,"width":283,"height":105},
