		{"id":"611d488ef0c71af2","type":"text","text":"4.training cycle","x":-200,"y":2400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"68a185aacc36372c","type":"text","text":"```\nfor epoch in range(100):\n\ty_pred = model(x_data)\n\tloss = criterion(y_pred,y_data)\n\tprint(epoch , loss)\n\t\n\toptimizer.zero_grad()\n\tloss.backward()\n\toptimizer.step()\n\t\nprint('w = ',model.linear.weight.item())\nprint('b = ',model.liner.bias.item())\n\nx_test = torch.Tensor([4.0])\ny_test = model(x_test)\nprint('y_pred = ',y_test.data)\n\n```","x":140,"y":2400,"width":609,"height":420},
